 had a partner, real estate partner. He owned 200 apartments here, he owned, my husband, plus expensive home, plus shopping center, the business, which we sold. We kept some, you know, shopping center. But anyway, all of that, because of that money, so we had the-- excuse me, no. The management are the real estate agent partner, he had a son who went to school with my son. They were not friends, but he was a little younger. And this is the one who was working for my husband for the-- he was working for my husband, you know, for probate, you know for-- from years that he was helping him, you know? And he said that my son threatened him with the email. He was being threatened by email, and that's why. So they arrested my son. And my son fought, fought it, because he went to Emory University.

